msgstr "Ṣé sẹ́fà yìí ni sẹ́fà agbègbè?"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check this box if the current server you are connected to is this entry."
msgstr "Fi àmì sí àpótí yìí tí olùpèsè tí o so mọ́ lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́ bá jẹ́ àkọsílẹ̀ yìí."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Master Server"
msgstr "Olùpèsè Olórí"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Sets this server to the Master server.  The Master server handles all Email operations"
msgstr "Ṣètò olùpèsè yìí gẹ́gẹ́ bí Olùpèsè Àgbà.  Olùpèsè Àgbà ni ó ń ṣàkóso gbogbo iṣẹ́ Ímeèlì"

